'''Tornadus''' (Japanese: '''トルネロス''' ''Tornelos'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

