==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Tornadus}} in its {{form|Tornadus|Incarnate Forme}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Vivid Voltage|Tornadus|142}} from the {{TCG|Vivid Voltage}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Brilliant Stars|Tornadus|126}} from the {{TCG|Brilliant Stars}} expansion.
*'''Blow Through''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Dark Explorers|Tornadus-EX|90}} from the {{TCG|Dark Explorers}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Y}}.

